<title>UK: Mirror names Kane Scottish Daily Record head.</title>
<headline>Mirror names Kane Scottish Daily Record head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>British newspaper and television company Mirror Group Plc said on Tuesday it had appointed William Kane as managing director of its Scottish Daily Record and Sunday Mail Ltd subsidiary.</p>
<p>Kane also becomes an executive director of Mirror Group.</p>
<p>Mirror Group said in a statement that Kane was chief executive of Caledonian Publishing Plc until Caledonian was taken over by Scottish Television Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
